OL,3,CScottish Labour must rediscover its
OL,4,Csoul, says leadership hopeful Michael
OL,5,CMarra
OL,7,FScottish Labour must "rediscover our
OL,8,Fsoul" and reconnect with the country,
OL,9,Fone of the party's leadership
OL,10,Fcontenders has said.
OL,12,FMichael Marra said the party must
OL,13,F"clean up" its internal culture and
OL,14,F"move beyond articulating what we are
OL,15,Fagainst and campaign on what we are
OL,16,Ffor".
