OL,3,CScottish Labour must rediscover its
OL,4,Csoul, says leadership hopeful Michael
OL,5,CMarra
OL,7,FThe North East MSP, the first to make
OL,8,Fthe leadership ballot, is vying to
OL,9,Freplace Anas Sarwar after he stood
OL,10,Fdown as Scottish Labour leader last
OL,11,Fmonth.
OL,13,FHe faces competition from new MSP Joe
OL,14,FFagan, while Monica Lennon hopes to be
OL,15,Fon the ballot but is yet to win enough
OL,16,Fsupport.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/6
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
