CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1786841292
OL,3,CScottish Labour must rediscover its
OL,4,Csoul, says leadership hopeful Michael
OL,5,CMarra
OL,7,FAhead of the nominations period
OL,8,Fclosing on Monday, Mr Marra said:
OL,9,F"Across the UK in May, we lost to
OL,10,Fpolitical insurgents railing against a
OL,11,FLabour leadership that had lost
OL,12,Fcontact with the country.
OL,14,F"But in Scotland we lost to a
OL,15,Ffeckless, incompetent and corrupt SNP
OL,16,Fwhose two-decade record has seen every
OL,17,FScottish institution weakened and the
OL,18,Fopportunities of our population
OL,19,Frecede."
OL,26,@qD@AOUvD@AOU{D@HO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/6
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1786841292
OL,3,CScottish Labour must rediscover its
OL,4,Csoul, says leadership hopeful Michael
OL,5,CMarra
OL,7,FHe said Scottish Labour had let down
OL,8,Fcommunities that "desperately need to
OL,9,Fsee change".
OL,11,FHe added: "We cannot spend the next
OL,12,Ffive years doing more of what we did
OL,13,Fthese last five, 10, 15 years,
OL,14,Frepeating the same mistakes, sniping
OL,15,Fand complaining.
OL,17,F"We need to clean up our internal
OL,18,Fculture and move beyond articulating
OL,19,Fwhat we are against, and campaign on
OL,20,Fwhat we are for.
OL,26,@pD@ROUqD@KO]sD@KOUyD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/6
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1786841292
OL,3,CScottish Labour must rediscover its
OL,4,Csoul, says leadership hopeful Michael
OL,5,CMarra
OL,7,F"It used to be that the public knew
OL,8,Fwhere Labour's hearts were and we had
OL,9,Fto win the argument that they could
OL,10,Ftrust our heads.
OL,12,F"A big part of our challenge is now
OL,13,Fthe opposite. We can make the sums add
OL,14,Fup but we must rediscover our soul and
OL,15,Freconnect with Scotland."
OL,17,FMr Marra said the party had to
OL,18,F"unite", "renew", and "rediscover" its
OL,19,Fmoral purpose.
OL,26,@oD@AOUtD@AOUwD@YO]zD@AOUzD@GO]zD@JOUzD@
OL,26,APO]zD@WOUzD@bO]
