OL,3,CScottish Labour must rediscover its
OL,4,Csoul, says leadership hopeful Michael
OL,5,CMarra
OL,7,F"I believe I am the leader to do
OL,8,Fthat," he said.
OL,10,FThe new leader will be announced on
OL,11,FSaturday September 19.
OL,26,@oD@AOUpD@FO]
